    "created_at": "2021-11-19T18:53:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-19T18:57:29Z",
    "body": "That is solved by partitioning with the \"ancestor chain bit\".  We can set site-for-cookies properly for the service worker context based on the information in the StorageKey.  That is better than trying to plumb something through because it applies to all fetches and not just passthrough fetches.\r\n\r\nEdit: Ancestor chain bit issue: https://github.com/privacycg/storage-partitioning/issues/25",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
